@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Same key and payload can be sent repeatedly
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1

{"customerId":1,"restaurantId":7,"totalAmount":249.50}

### Conflict, not a second order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1

{"customerId":1,"restaurantId":7,"totalAmount":250}

### Replace ID with the actual create result
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1

### Missing order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/9223372036854775807

### First cursor page
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customerId=1&limit=2

### Replace cursor with nextCursor from the actual response
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customerId=1&limit=2&cursor=1:1

### Offset comparison
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customerId=1&limit=2&pagination=offset&offset=2
